        "recommendation": "Scope the lookup to the caller's organization: call `currentUser(req)` and query `WHERE id = $1 AND org_id = $2` with `[id, user.orgId]`, answering 404 when no row matches so other organizations' ids are not confirmed. Add a test asserting the detail query is bound to the caller's `orgId`, as the list test does (CWE-639 / CWE-862). Attack: any signed-in user of organization A sends `GET /invoices/42`, `GET /invoices/43`, ... and receives the number, total and date of every other organization's invoices, since ids are sequential integers.",
